WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:25.650
I love the scenes between
Lisey and her sisters because

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:30.530
I tried to capture some of
that sibling rivalry dynamic.

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:36.870
To me, it’s funny and it’s touching
that the way we are as children

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:41.249
with our brothers and sisters
kind of lasts into adulthood.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:47.547
Julianne, Jennifer, and Joan catch
that feeling of real sisterhood.

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:51.593
To me, those are my favorite scenes.

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:58.850
Something that is so well constructed
by Stephen is these three sisters,

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:05.106
how Lisey, Darla, and Amanda, they
are so different from each other,

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:08.026
how they love and protect each other.

00:01:08.651 --> 00:01:13.907
The core close relationship
of the sisters is pretty

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.784
central to the whole piece.

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:20.538
They have a quirky, funny,
combative style between them.

00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:23.500
Like all families, I think
they understand each other

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.669
and as the episodes go on they
really become more and more

00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:30.256
united as a team in their
efforts to protect Lisey.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:36.387
Lisey loves her sisters very
much and when her sister

00:01:36.387 --> 00:01:41.059
needs help she starts to remember
things that happened to her

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:44.646
and starts to realize that there’s
a way that she can help her sister.

